and Sidcup Grammar School Townley Grammar School London Bromley Grammar Schools London Bromley 11 Plus"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 0, "end": 14, "text": "October 2025 ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 15, "end": 134, "text": "Remember – passing the 11 plus doesn ’ t guarantee that your child will be allocated a place at your preferred school ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 135, "end": 206, "text": "Many grammar schools are often oversubscribed with qualified children ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 207, "end": 316, "text": "Schools and their admissions authorities work through admissions criteria to prioritise children for places ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 317, "end": 400, "text": "We ’ ve included the admissions criteria for Wirral Grammar School for Boys below ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 401, "end": 441, "text": "What subjects are on the entrance exam ?"}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 442, "end": 551, "text": "Wirral Grammar School for Boys uses the Wirral Admissions Test to assess children ’ s suitability for entry ."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d02", "start": 552, "end": 586, "text": "This test consists of two papers ,"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d03", "start": 0, "end": 328, "text": "Teacher Simon Ascroft Staff 120 Gender Girls [ 3 ] Age 11 to 18 Enrolment 1,057 ( 2022 ) [ 2 ] Houses Barber Dodds Hodgson Lever Colour ( s ) Publication Nuntius Former pupils Old Wirralians Website www.wirralgrammargirls.com Wirral Grammar School for Girls is an 11–18 girls maintained selective grammar school founded in 1931."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d03", "start": 329, "end": 463, "text": "It is situated on a 9.1 acres (3.7 ha) site to the west of Port Sunlight at Cross Lane, Bebington, on the Wirral Peninsula in England."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d03", "start": 464, "end": 527, "text": "Academically successful, the school was placed 42nd in the top."}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 0, "end": 131, "text": "for the Wirral Grammar School for Girls 11 Plus Exam Essentially you have 5 options when it comes to helping your child to prepare."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 132, "end": 168, "text": "1/ Some parents use a Private Tutor."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 169, "end": 298, "text": "If you want to start your search for a suitable one, we provide links to some Private tutors in Wirral and Liverpool to help you."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 299, "end": 345, "text": "These can cost between £2500 and £6000 a year."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 346, "end": 435, "text": "For help thinking about which private tutor might be right for you see our guidance page."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 436, "end": 493, "text": "2/ Other parents use a Tuition Centre with group tuition."}, "D5S7": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d04", "start": 494, "end": 500, "text": "If you"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0240-5429bc78922f:d05", "start": 0, "end": 140, "text": "Wirral Grammar School for Girls Wirral Grammar School for Girls is an all-girls grammar school on the Wirral Peninsula, Merseyside, England."}, "D6S2": {"document_